sequenceDiagram
  participant Source as Public UCI archive
  participant Audit as Data audit
  participant Analyze as Deterministic analysis
  participant Verify as Holdout verification
  participant Engineer as Engineering decision

  Source->>Audit: raw cycles + component profile
  Audit->>Audit: verify rows, widths, stable flag
  Audit->>Analyze: source-flagged stable cycles
  Analyze->>Analyze: matched factorial feature discovery
  Analyze->>Verify: frozen candidate definitions
  Verify->>Engineer: repeatability + cross-sensitivity evidence
  Engineer->>Engineer: preserve inconclusive state
  Engineer-->>Source: independent validation is still required
